{# I4.2: steps to mitigate risks for vulnerable participants. #}
{% for m in s.vulnerable_mitigations %}
- {{ m.risk }}: {{ m.mitigation }}
{% endfor %}
- Consent: the information sheet is explained in person or by video call and understanding is checked before consent; participants have {{ p.decision_time }} to decide and can ask questions at any time.
- During sessions: participants can take breaks, skip any question and stop at any time without giving a reason.
{% if s.safeguarding %}
- Support: {{ s.safeguarding_names }} can be contacted if a participant becomes distressed.
{% endif %}
